§9 · RÉGIMEN DE CONSTRUCCIÓN (Hevner)

7 guidelines (L1336–1362).
3 ciclos (L1563–1652):
    "These three cycles must be present and clearly identifiable."
    (L1569–1570)

Design Cycle · L1649–1667:
    "The internal design cycle is the heart of any design science
     research project." (L1649–1650)
    "iterates more rapidly between the construction of an artifact,
     its evaluation, and subsequent feedback to refine the design."
     (L1651–1653)
